{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Final CI-log acceptance evidence for 5caa after the parser follow-up landed:\n\n- Gerrit change 2479 merged the local composite uv action.\n- Post-merge main-health run 33574990286 exposed a real PowerShell parser defect in the action before install; follow-up Gerrit change 2501 fixed it.\n- Gerrit change 2501 merged as 024a6a2278134128be0c76c8d7c60e41b4ba817d after LLM-Review+1 and Verified+1.\n- Successful CI run used for the acceptance check: GitHub Actions run 33575422978 (`Gerrit Verified Gate`) for change 2501 / commit 23078fc23d0bd9d2fef1f1fd79f244f80d50340f.\n\nExact grep evidence from run 33575422978:\n\n```sh\ngh run view 33575422978 --repo navapbc/rebar --log | grep -F 'Successfully installed uv 0.12.7'\n# exit 0; representative lines:\n# build-and-test / lint + type-check ... Successfully installed uv 0.12.7 from uv-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz\n# build-and-test / pytest (macos-latest, py3.13) ... Successfully installed uv 0.12.7 from uv-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz\n# build-and-test / pytest (ubuntu-latest, py3.13) ... Successfully installed uv 0.12.7 from uv-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz\n\ngh run view 33575422978 --repo navapbc/rebar --log | grep -F 'Fetching manifest data'\n# exit 1; no matches\n\ngh run view 33575422978 --repo navapbc/rebar --log | grep -F 'raw.githubusercontent.com'\n# exit 1; no matches\n```\n\nAdditional post-merge main-health run 33577216351 on merged SHA 024a6a2278134128be0c76c8d7c60e41b4ba817d also showed the same uv acceptance greps (`Successfully installed uv 0.12.7` exit 0, both forbidden strings exit 1), though that broader scheduled-style sweep later ended cancelled because of an unrelated Windows suite failure after uv setup. The 5caa uv setup acceptance condition is satisfied by the successful Verified run above. No force overrides used."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788312076099055481,"uuid":"ffec9bf4-8877-4682-a9e9-d03bf33e830c"}